        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Rocket Engineers",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111806466450",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 270c38fa-0c5d-4ce6-93a1-15de1231ab43).Image",
        "Description": "As well as military tech, Robert Knox and Kronstadt are also looking to develop in the field of space; they are developing a rocket and are planning to conduct their first launch tests later this year. Obviously, because space sucks, we need to stop that launch from happening. So we need to eliminate Kronstadt&apos;s space engineering experts, Derek McInnis and Ellen Ives, who are co-leading the  project. For an added bonus, use explosives to launch them like their rocket!",
